      "text": "输入\n                            3\r\n10 30 50\r\n55\n                        \n                        \n                            输出\n                            2\n                        \n\n                                                    \n                                输入\n                                5\r\n1 10 20 25 30\r\n30\n                            \n                            \n                                输出\n                                3\n                            \n                        \n                                                    \n                                输入\n                                10\r\n1 12 20 18 3 6 8 9 19 12\r\n25\n                            \n                            \n                                输出\n                                5"
